<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Feb unemployment rises to 2.6 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Feb unemployment rises to 2.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's seasonally-adjusted jobless rate in January rose to a 34-month high 2.6 percent from 1.9 percent a year earlier, provisional National Statistical Office (NSO) figures showed on Sunday.</p>
<p>						   Feb    Jan   Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Unemployment (pct)		     2.6    2.4     1.9</p>
<p>						  (3.2)  (2.6)   (2.3)</p>
<p>Note: Seasonally unadjusted figures in brackets. The NSO figures showed the economically active population rose to 20.93 million in February from 20.32 million a year ago and fell from 20.95 million in January. </p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
